                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans passed legislation that eliminates the Affordable Care Act\u2019s premium tax credits, spiking costs for Californians by $2,500 annually. That\u2019s unacceptable. I\u2019m proud to cosponsor the Protecting Healthcare and Lowering Costs Act to permanently extend the ACA\u2019s premium tax credits and defend affordable health care access for our community members. https://t.co/png1qiIOAZ",
