                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Access to essential healthcare is non-negotiable for all California families \u2013 and that includes quality at-home, telehealth, and hospice care. It was great speaking with dedicated folks from the National Alliance for Care at Home about how I can support their mission to make high-quality home care affordable and accessible for our community members.",
