                "text": "When Congressional Republicans passed H.R. 1, they voted to end health care premium tax credits through the Affordable Care Act. Now, Californians are about to see their premiums spike by over 10% \u2013 that\u2019s unacceptable. https://t.co/XlEbnv9WLB",
