                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "House Republicans would rather shut down the federal government than protect health care for over 40,000 CA-45 residents who rely on Medicaid or the ACA\u2019s enhanced premium tax credit to stay healthy. That\u2019s unacceptable.",
