                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our troops can't count on their next paycheck. Health insurance premiums are doubling, tripling, and even quadrupling. Veterans and seniors await critical updates about their benefits. This shut down must end now. I\u2019m here in Washington making sure your voices are heard, and I\u2019ll work with anyone \u2013 Republican or Democrat \u2013 to ensure our government works for you.",
