                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If Congress doesn't act, CA-45 families will see their health insurance costs more than double. That\u2019s thousands more per year that Orange County residents will have to spend on health care while grocery, gas, and utility prices are already on the rise. Speaker Johnson must call the House back into session, open the government and address this crisis. https://t.co/3FhFNszE0A",
